                <note rend="inline" type="source">721.23/2152: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Peru</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Dearing</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-03-26T17:00:00-05:00">March 26, 1934—5 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>23. Your 36, March 24, 1 p.m., last sentence. What are the “developments”
                    mentioned in the reports in question?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
